# Keep the docker build context small and free of anything Blizzard-derived
# or irrelevant to the server image (context = repo root, see
# infra/docker/server.Dockerfile).
.git
data
node_modules
deps/azerothcore/.git
deps/azerothcore/var
deps/azerothcore/env
deps/azerothcore/build*
runner
wrath-mcp/sdk
wrath-mcp/mcp
wrath-mcp/.git
wrath-mcp/node_modules
wiki
docs
dashboard
collector
minimap
infra/chart
# Claude Code worktrees: whole checkouts with their node_modules, sent to the
# daemon on every server build for nothing.
**/.claude
# Env files never go to the daemon, at any depth. build-images.sh builds from a
# git archive, where there are none; a hand-run `docker build .` from a
# checkout is what this is for.
**/.env
**/.env.*
